y yet.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t19_o15","terms":["no removals yet","removed section empty"]},{"doc_id":"d_2178db3bf707039cc2ca70aa1c76bf0903f35819e621456b9389455111ac6bd4","exact_quote":"is removed, its row moves to this section with a link to the changelog entry","kind":"observe","local_id":"t19_o16","terms":["removal bookkeeping","changelog link"]},{"as_of":20251125,"based_on":["t19_o10"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t19_c3","object":"2025-11-25 (SEP-2596)","predicate":"were deprecated in","stance":"reported","subject":"includeContext thisServer/allServers values","text":"The includeContext \"thisServer\"/\"allServers\" values were deprecated in 2025-11-25 under SEP-2596; migration is to omit the field or use \"none\"."},{"as_of":20250326,"based_on":["t19_o11","t19_o13"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t19_c4","object":"2025-03-26 (SEP-2596)","predicate":"was deprecated in","stance":"reported","subject":"HTTP+SSE transport","text":"The HTTP+SSE transport was deprecated in 2025-03-26 under SEP-2596, migrating to Streamable HTTP; earliest removal is three months after SEP-2596 reaches Final."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t19_o2"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t19_c5","object":"new implementations","predicate":"SHOULD NOT be done by","stance":"qualified","subject":"adoption of deprecated features","text":"New implementations SHOULD NOT adopt a Deprecated feature and existing implementations SHOULD migrate before its earliest removal; this is a recommendation, not a mandate."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t19_o5"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t19_c7","object":"a derived, non-normative view","predicate":"is qualified as","stance":"qualified","subject":"deprecation registry","text":"The registry is a derived view; per-feature deprecation notices and changelog entries are the normative records, so the table itself is not authoritative."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t19_o15","t19_o16"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t19_c8","object":"this revision","predicate":"have not yet occurred as of","stance":"reported","subject":"feature removals under the policy","text":"No features have been removed under the deprecation policy yet; removed rows will move to the Removed section with a changelog link."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t19_o14"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t19_c9","object":"SEP-2596 transition provisions","predicate":"were reclassified as Deprecated by","stance":"reported","subject":"HTTP+SSE transport and includeContext values","text":"The HTTP+SSE transport and includeContext values were already described as deprecated before the lifecycle policy existed; SEP-2596 reclassifies them under transition provisions."},{"based_on":["t19_o13"],"falsifier":"A statement in this section giving a fixed calendar date for SEP-2596 Final or for the HTTP+SSE removal.","kind":"hypothesis","local_id":"t19_h1","text":"The HTTP+SSE deprecation's earliest removal is open-ended because it depends on SEP-2596 reaching Final, a milestone not dated in this section."},{"based_on":["t19_o5"],"falsifier":"A statement that the registry table itself is the normative record for deprecations.","kind":"hypothesis","local_id":"t19_h2","text":"Because the registry is derived and the per-feature notices are normative, this table may lag or diverge from the authoritative deprecation records."},{"about":["deprecation registry","normative records"],"kind":"question","local_id":"t19_q1","needed":"Check the per-feature deprecation notices and changelog entries referenced by SEP-2577, PR #2858 and SEP-2596.","text":"Do the per-feature deprecation notices or changelog entries add removal dates or conditions not present in this derived registry?"},{"about":["HTTP+SSE transport","SEP-2596"],"kind":"question","local_id":"t19_q2","needed":"Check SEP-2596 status in the modelcontextprotocol repository.","text":"When does SEP-2596 reach Final, fixing the HTTP+SSE earliest-removal date?"}],"scope":{"docs":["d_2178db3bf707039cc2ca70aa1c76bf0903f35819e621456b9389455111ac6bd4"],"ranges":[["d_2178