erResult`: the server is modern. Select a\n  mutually supported version from `supportedVersions` and continue.","suggested_span":{"doc_id":"d_46be7e4179c08889e46e432fb507e04ddb0ad5be742316f30490452fb8a74c12","end_byte":5797,"start_byte":5660},"trailing_word":"a"},"field":"exact_quote","message":"a quote keeps the clause it belongs to: quote from the start of the sentence when it negates what follows, and to the end of the clause when the quote ends on a word like 'from' or 'with'","obligation":null,"status":"error"},"index":2,"local_id":"t52_o3"},{"error":{"code":"BAD_FIELD","expected_by_kernel":{"exact_bytes_in_section":"The server returns any other error, or does not respond within a\n  reasonable timeout:","rule":"ends_mid_clause","suggested_exact_quote":"The server returns any other error, or does not respond within a\n  reasonable timeout:","suggested_span":{"doc_id":"d_46be7e4179c08889e46e432fb507e04ddb0ad5be742316f30490452fb8a74c12","end_byte":6177,"start_byte":6091},"trailing_word":"a"},"field":"exact_quote","message":"a quote keeps the clause it belongs to: quote from the start of the sentence when it negates what follows, and to the end of the clause when the quote ends on a word like 'from' or 'with'","obligation":null,"status":"error"},"index":5,"local_id":"t52_o6"},{"error":{"code":"BAD_FIELD","expected_by_kernel":{"exact_bytes_in_section":"- The server returns any other error, or does not respond within a\n  reasonable timeout: the server is legacy.","negation_before":"- The server returns any other error, or does not respond within a","rule":"negation_before","suggested_exact_quote":"- The server returns any other error, or does not respond within a\n  reasonable timeout: the server is legacy.","suggested_span":{"doc_id":"d_46be7e4179c08889e46e432fb507e04ddb0ad5be742316f30490452fb8a74c12","end_byte":6199,"start_byte":6089}},"field":"exact_quote","message":"a quote keeps the clause it belongs to: quote from the start of the sentence when it negates what follows, and to the end of the clause when the quote ends on a word like 'from' or 'with'","obligation":null,"status":"error"},"index":6,"local_id":"t52_o7"},{"error":{"code":"BAD_FIELD","expected_by_kernel":{"exact_bytes_in_section":"probing is still **RECOMMENDED**: some legacy servers do not validate that a\nrequest arrives after `initialize` and would process an era-ambiguous method\n(such as `tools/call`) under legacy semantics.","rule":"ends_mid_clause","suggested_exact_quote":"probing is still **RECOMMENDED**: some legacy servers do not validate that a\nrequest arrives after `initialize` and would process an era-ambiguous method\n(such as `tools/call`) under legacy semantics.","suggested_span":{"doc_id":"d_46be7e4179c08889e46e432fb507e04ddb0ad5be742316f30490452fb8a74c12","end_byte":6722,"start_byte":6522},"trailing_word":"a"},"field":"exact_quote","message":"a quote keeps the clause it belongs to: quote from the start of the sentence when it negates what follows, and to the end of the clause when the quote ends on a word like 'from' or 'with'","obligation":null,"status":"error"},"index":10,"local_id":"t52_o11"},{"error":{"code":"BAD_FIELD","expected_by_kernel":{"exact_bytes_in_section":"some legacy servers do not validate that a\nrequest arrives after `initialize` and would process an era-ambiguous method","negation_before":"some legacy servers do not validate that a","rule":"negation_before","suggested_exact_quote":"some legacy servers do not validate that a\nrequest arrives after `initialize` and would process an era-ambiguous method","suggested_span":{"doc_id":"d_46be7e4179c08889e46e432fb507e04ddb0ad5be742316f30490452fb8a74c12","end_byte":6675,"start_byte":6556}},"field":"exact_quote","message":"a quote keeps the clause it belongs to: quote from the start of the sentence when it negates what follows, and to the end of the clause when the quote ends on a word like 'from' or 'with'","obligation":null,"status":"error"},"index":11,"local_id":"t52_o12"},{"err