rced maximum timeout","predicate":"MAY be done, subject to","stance":"qualified","subject":"timeout clock reset on progress notifications","text":"Implementations MAY reset the timeout clock on progress notifications, but SHOULD always enforce a maximum timeout regardless of progress."},{"based_on":["t54_o2","t54_o3","t54_o4","t54_o6"],"falsifier":"A later revision of this section stating these SHOULD/MAY items as unconditional MUST requirements without change.","kind":"hypothesis","local_id":"t54_h1","text":"The shutdown, timeout and error-handling rules here are largely SHOULD/MAY, leaving optionality that later revisions could tighten to MUST."}],"scope":{"docs":["d_487ca4ef224fdb205202f2d1e490f283ebe2344493a1f4c00e2cc952de5a677d"],"ranges":[["d_487ca4ef224fdb205202f2d1e490f283ebe2344493a1f4c00e2cc952de5a677d",5981,8196]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"0cfda6a42d4c5df997ea2f33520cf4fbeea755b5923b8d819f30b55b7b3fcab2","outcome":{"kind":"records","result":{"accepted":["693fa6fe420abb44a2b206b602bafee13b57948b6383015b5e11d1a96248e9bc","28902f1a0bb80cbdb073f267b6740700f174fb14513f2e69db5c2293be41a3c5","9625f72b991ffa65c980c29074b8b43e2b4ea1288d044c5398134d0e3ff584b3","563ffeab69917f02a45e38952919b3785175f406aa9f962b54b3abca8c69d8a8","7aaa0120f33cc6582e0c1925c4593f1ac7755b2c8042a98285a1e6487375a4ff"],"error":null,"failed_index":null}},"request_hash":"4901eae249a013473220407b928ee3ee3e628995c3d7581914ab96845d248067","submission_id":"TR54-a3f4cb34e4fae775#2"},"hash":"e58c363e6754664f1da0613283963cb86e2cb6c85363dfcfb3ebff65d3a22059","header":{"body_hash":"d1191f4b51340f8e03809a100331cb198d6ffc91e3c837e05df78306db6adde1","format":"sbgk-session-log/3","previous":"b64b1d0a83ef55a3d2b879b844d7d100463e4f9abede24f42dbfa90f31d93c08","records_root":"a3fbc1cbc0cac2f6ff16695ef51daba22be4b6854707ebabda3363bbc56345b1","seq":266,"wal_op":"audit"}}
