5b","exact_quote":"return `Content-Type: text/event-stream`, to initiate an SSE stream, or\n   `Content-Type:","kind":"observe","local_id":"t60_o13","terms":["SSE stream","JSON response choice"]},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t60_o7"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t60_c4","object":"POST and GET","predicate":"MUST be a single path supporting","stance":"reported","subject":"MCP endpoint","text":"The Streamable HTTP server MUST provide a single MCP endpoint path supporting both POST and GET methods."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t60_o10","t60_o11"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t60_c6","object":"application/json and text/event-stream","predicate":"MUST be new POSTs with Accept header listing","stance":"reported","subject":"client POST requests","text":"Every JSON-RPC message from the client MUST be a new HTTP POST to the MCP endpoint, and the client MUST send an Accept header listing both application/json and text/event-stream."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t60_o13"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t60_c8","object":"client","predicate":"MUST be either SSE or JSON, both supported by","stance":"reported","subject":"server response to requests","text":"If input contains requests, the server MUST return either text/event-stream (SSE) or application/json, and the client MUST support both cases."}],"scope":{"docs":["d_4bc9c307374945cef1fa7bdb9143f1965e53a345ab1ed3bf2b06f2510e14915b"],"ranges":[["d_4bc9c307374945cef1fa7bdb9143f1965e53a345ab1ed3bf2b06f2510e14915b",0,5820]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"9b2aee9f97532657974fede3e27cf06f9015bae54053adb168c3716a0869367d","outcome":{"kind":"records","result":{"accepted":["3704b256ee636b362aa819bc78e72114e3a783782a39dcedd658883d9cb9645f","6e3422ffb81ed0db94a56c1ec61157c1893b3b0a3794945c16c398c49829cd95","cd79942cdd1de5a939b5e5fefd1b6d894aacf9f9a4a59ff5fce4e75b15826717","00c26177ad816a4201df2543c6e2421483d723fbdc0dd61c9ab09f979211d747","a4f5ce28a780a7cda9e10d1c6b82f0e84e64e12de01a2baeafbe64a5becc0058","0726a651227dacea865719a61c6ad7fb130576a4dd7fce7