:"observe","local_id":"t63_o4","terms":["_meta prefix","reserved namespace"]},{"doc_id":"d_68a9337c46c31a3f0e9eafcca98f89260dc7a424155fdeaa631a415f80aa23eb","exact_quote":"fields marked as required **MUST** be included on every request.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t63_o5","terms":["per-request protocol fields","MUST","required"]},{"doc_id":"d_68a9337c46c31a3f0e9eafcca98f89260dc7a424155fdeaa631a415f80aa23eb","exact_quote":"Servers use these\nto identify the protocol version and capabilities in use without relying on any\nprior connection state.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t63_o6","terms":["per-request fields","statelessness","version identification"]},{"doc_id":"d_68a9337c46c31a3f0e9eafcca98f89260dc7a424155fdeaa631a415f80aa23eb","exact_quote":"Clients **SHOULD** include `io.modelcontextprotocol/clientInfo` on every request","kind":"observe","local_id":"t63_o8","terms":["clientInfo","SHOULD","optionality"]},{"doc_id":"d_68a9337c46c31a3f0e9eafcca98f89260dc7a424155fdeaa631a415f80aa23eb","exact_quote":"A server **MUST NOT** rely on capabilities the client has not declared.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t63_o9","terms":["clientCapabilities","MUST NOT","declared capabilities"]},{"doc_id":"d_68a9337c46c31a3f0e9eafcca98f89260dc7a424155fdeaa631a415f80aa23eb","exact_quote":"Official [extensions](/specification/2026-07-28/basic/versioning#extension-negotiation)","kind":"observe","local_id":"t63_o12","terms":["extensions","_meta keys","versioning"]},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t63_o1","t63_o2"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t63_c1","object":"implementations","predicate":"MUST NOT be assumed by","stance":"reported","subject":"values at reserved _meta keys","text":"Implementations MUST NOT make assumptions about values at MCP-reserved _meta keys."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t63_o3"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t63_c2","object":"implementations","predicate":"SHOULD be used by","stance":"qualified","subject":"reverse DNS notation for _meta prefixes","text":"Use of reverse DNS notation for _meta prefixes is a SHOULD recommendation, not a mandate."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t63_o4"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t63_c3","object":"MCP use","predicate":"are reserved for","stance":"reported","subject":"_meta prefixes with second label modelcontextprotocol or mcp","text":"Prefixes whose second label is modelcontextprotocol or mcp are reserved for MCP use."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t63_o5"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t63_c4","object":"every request","predicate":"MUST be included on","stance":"reported","subject":"required per-request protocol fields","text":"Required per-request io.modelcontextprotocol/* _meta fields MUST be included on every request."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t63_o6"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t63_c5","object":"prior connection state","predicate":"allow identification of version and capabilities without","stance":"reported","subject":"per-request protocol fields","text":"Per-request protocol fields let servers identify protocol version and capabilities without relying on prior connection state."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t63_o8"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t63_c7","object":"clients","predicate":"SHOULD be included by","stance":"qualified","subject":"clientInfo on every request","text":"Clients SHOULD include io.modelcontextprotocol/clientInfo on every request unless specifically configured not to."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t63_o12"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t63_c10","object":"official extension documentation","predicate":"are defined in","stance":"open","subject":"additional _meta keys under io.modelcontextprotocol/","text":"Additional _meta keys under the io.modelcontextprotocol/ prefix are defined by official extensions and specified in extension documentation, not in this section."},{"about":["clientInfo","serverInfo","reverse DNS prefix"],"kind":"question","local_id":"t63_q1","needed":"Check later specification revisions of the _meta section for requirement-strength changes.","text":"Do later revisions tighten the SHOULD rules for clientInfo/serverInfo or reverse DNS prefixes into MUST requirements?"},{"about":["extensions","_meta keys"],"kind":"question","local_id":"t63_q2","needed":"Check the extension-negotiation section and each extension's documentation.","text":"Which official extensions define additional io.modelcontextprotocol/ _meta keys, and are those definitions stable?"}],"scope":{"docs":["d_68a9337c46c31a3f0e9eafcca98f89260dc7a424155fdeaa631a415f80aa23eb"],"ranges":[["d_68a9337c46c31a3f0e9eafcca98f89260dc7a424155fdeaa631a415f80aa23eb",14242,20112]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"3d359761d732517760a0434b73184fdf865d3dcbbff150460a85ac38b668c6c9","outcome":{"kind":"records","result":{"accepted":["7092723744a886b0cea66a92bed7f2c72ade89671036419dac6aaf7860185679","dd92cf9882f540d254682da19c5098894599f5660d29a3c83efa92d5c70358b9","3f73b314131543ca0aa013c584056a6ba2f0a89cfd3c6e88d9b127695d6e2d63","55061f58a090dd829c05b402282c82ad2c08145c6ccd9decf722108f853988e8","ecc4e4bf16ceb7faa6ba1312eee2631bab7992c25683419410a3ca5c78440e0b","5cebbbc7934f16ee185986d220215fdd2dacff60e7f7232d0c6dc5fb7bb8ab89","e0c755749ba2119388c5acd2323cbabc74c421ba1a39c6282032ebdd6f946638","466d659ba4954ed61d02e41e2ee0dc0f67db18e1f9313af9d6f4c2ceeafe234f","b8e4735cd5f0dc3403eca0f32854a00eb46bd8ee8fdbe21039764568001ff228","d12c0609d9e5110500bfbe8782c785d1c472bff6700b4a19b784f54b3090a215","21eb337a51bcc61684ec924d5190cb4e4c514e4c48ef333bb7a37de930ed83f5","b65c3aa53ad8b32326eca47ba91498b93c55ddfd8673d8e83089b49376279426","a1938046ffdd867e15776575b404919d3ee547286e0307e18c732e7cbd0cc317","5fa674c05c3b7031b730c98e170db7ed0fec6e809138cf6ad25da268d4952071","1cb0c2f98d1973a6e46b80b4f16ca00b28584b951eb981a138f650bb70e4543f","efbeeddc80837112ee74b03c71cb831269d6419593d6ed48f9e474ccced900b1","a86150398f0b6ab8dbd8269c02de381ee999c0e8a3812d6a3e1979716515e3f1","b90cb88d8cabf2054416d30bd2268b6cff08488abb2a2b9a1e1a77097401f4d6"],"error":null,"failed_index":null}},"request_hash":"0a0fb11cf6bfeb163eeb7b68d7ba2c1f162d155