{"body":{"actor":"w1","audit_root":"26ac9b7f1b022d851e080307d9d9538587ff76d758d20e59be5d571411787c02","command":{"allowed_records":["0c885f8470b25ebc51ca36f0f4f71018d6629a236e1f6a39a44d0602f73e5234","30b42a7ab9212b145c26f8c3152765d0ba3af8c5c020549baecd1d39ce47c3f4","30d75310ba2bad3440c9def6f6c7440e10fb0f2207a2e4b6988cb09b04e3db91","399b4b685f545ff205588b497f5477cb14da443874d8c3bf084e061f8a65e49a","3a2f36073d683624bd9f06eef7e4a1fa227212e198efbf74274040a652e4c6ff","63ce29418b3e97097f4c4bbaa7d41fe413c01a8b153b1416b04ba6a71f5e028b","6ca6665902277bc7a80dca0e5b2f93e1864409a7c11629686cc7bebe27acca7d","76f502a4467387cf1b20986139e5b7161f6c6ec4bf2369089e98440ac3fe68a8","8599201b97088cc4f0ffaade38e4e5019522853c782930f3cd8c6b365549c2fa","b57ad2fc70004f64ca8630d261d42642ea3533a01cbd708cbc2b8c0c3755afb4","bb4a5f59d822ad177ec3ce946ebe0b9bea40d6a0e6affa45895c672741758b02","f9b13ccee8f191b798c3d14c9931c1efc4ca0b830a1b81f22055d85becb402bd"],"directive":"T69-79bc1723244bbb62","kind":"submit","lines":[{"doc_id":"d_7a1bf6bc8d125d79e704fa29cde580d628f34c03999b80eb772748554145086e","exact_quote":"- The client **SHOULD NOT** send requests other than\n  [pings](/specification/2025-11-25/basic/utilities/ping) before the server has responded to the\n  `initialize` request.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t69_o2","terms":["client requests before initialize response","SHOULD NOT","pings exception"]},{"doc_id":"d_7a1bf6bc8d125d79e704fa29cde580d628f34c03999b80eb772748554145086e","exact_quote":"- The server **SHOULD NOT** send requests other than\n  [pings](/specification/2025-11-25/basic/utilities/ping) and\n  [logging](/specification/2025-11-25/server/utilities/logging) before receiving the `initialized`\n  notification.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t69_o3","terms":["server requests before initialized notification","SHOULD NOT","pings and logging exception"]},{"doc_id":"d_7a1bf6bc8d125d79e704fa29cde580d628f34c03999b80eb772748554145086e","exact_quote":"\"protocolVersion\": \"2025-11-25\",\n    \"capabilities\": {\n      \"roots\": {","kind":"observe","local_id":"t69_o7","terms":["protocol version 2025-11-25","initialize request example"]},{"doc_id":"d_7a1bf6bc8d125d79e704fa29cde580d628f34c03999b80eb772748554145086e","exact_quote":"\"tasks\": {\n        \"requests\": {\n          \"elicitation\": {","kind":"observe","local_id":"t69_o8","terms":["tasks capability","client capabilities example"]},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t69_o2","t69_o3"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t69_c2","object":"before initialize response / initialized notification","predicate":"SHOULD NOT be sent (except pings/logging)","stance":"reported","subject":"requests during initialization","text":"Before the server responds to initialize, the client SHOULD NOT send requests other than pings; before receiving initialized, the server SHOULD NOT send requests other than pings and logging."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t69_o7","t69_o8"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t69_c5","object":"protocol version 2025-11-25","predicate":"appears in initialize example for","stance":"reported","subject":"tasks capability","text":"The section's initialize examples use protocol version 2025-11-25 and show a tasks capability (with requests such as elicitation) in the client capability object."},{"based_on":["t69_o2","t69_o3","t69_o4","t69_o5"],"falsifier":"A later revision of this section stating these SHOULD/SHOULD NOT items as unconditional MUST requirements without change.","kind":"hypothesis","local_id":"t69_h1","text":"The lifecycle section's optionality (SHOULD NOT request restrictions, SHOULD latest-version preference, SHOULD disconnect on version mismatch) is normative but not mandatory, so later revisions could tighten these into MUSTs."},{"based_on":["t69_o8"],"falsifier":"A statement in this section labeling tasks support as stable/normative or as experimental.","kind":"hypothesis","local_id":"t69_h2","text":"The tasks capability shown in the initialize examples is presented without stability labeling in this section, leaving open whether it is experimental or stable."}],"scope":{"docs":["d_7a1bf6bc8d125d79e704fa29cde580d628f34c03999b80eb772748554145086e"],"ranges":[["d_7a1bf6bc8d125d79e704fa29cde580d628f34c03999b80eb772748554145086e",0,4807]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"42af66206a74b37f5e4c004116fccb24093860008b45a107f2316b372473fd65","outcome":{"kind":"records","result":{"accepted":["d15fd64f6010cc9c6b9d138ddc4293844fc1f64bba0bb9bb1053bf6eeb8dd638","23117a5579a9503fe442aa93e11a96a13425651bb0e57e55f38623693caea3b7","adfa2d16b3a04020b312450ede10b937c17db82a4a0a518426eed1c8186dafd7","3ddd7ce5c9484ffe81541ae1cf0aaa148d3825305c5b530e7036661173544613","27267c384704a3d07f16f21498498964984a391cbca1b33316fe3f742b415ddd","85c4180edf4577fe5170ec5eb15d133b192fd7993ead09b8c14ab4d11617004d","bf558b5a824082c8e8816450a244418cd0fc218c9ecb774464529d508168365e","f73657f03155ff0171111618a05801882d8169bd8409c770aa7d2b61a4f4eff6"],"error":null,"failed_index":null}},"request_hash":"b4af5a965e5e4626ca34b6f8f226f6f5b492f613577c20656cb533d6e4e5e11d","submission_id":"T69-79bc1723244bbb62#2"},"hash":"686083211eac5872e9577ee9a3cb83e07c7f0ec419975af7c060d1863edd3248","header":{"body_hash":"fba6ffe6e56b8e2a11aba9a2dc94be25471f7bb7bc165e6705061bd4ced8e6c5","format":"sbgk-session-log/3","previous":"73b1834ff61c93e14e5adade19d5eb679e287e76ff041039ab4a530c7af252bc","records_root":"a6fb7fb773ec315356db574098e0b4fecde2d6fb74b49361e6795b497ab31566","seq":342,"wal_op":"audit"}}
