roduced in\n    `2025-11-25`.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t80_o6","terms":["removal of elicitationId in URL mode","introduced in 2025-11-25"]},{"doc_id":"d_e78b49b5f4912f5115eb9b9dbd5b8785bf919e27b2c1bfd2e93e784e7ef9a936","exact_quote":"Loosen `inputSchema` and `outputSchema` to allow any JSON Schema 2020-12 keywords, and\n    `structuredContent` to allow any JSON value.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t80_o16","terms":["loosened inputSchema and outputSchema","structuredContent allows any JSON value"]},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t80_o3","t80_o4"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t80_c2","object":"keyed by issuer identifier; re-register on change","predicate":"are bound to the issuing authorization server","stance":"reported","subject":"client credentials","text":"Clients MUST key persisted client credentials by issuer identifier, MUST NOT reuse them with a different authorization server, and MUST re-register when the authorization server changes."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t80_o5","t80_o6","t80_o7"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t80_c3","object":"under Multi Round-Trip Requests","predicate":"are removed, superseding their 2025-11-25 introduction","stance":"superseded","subject":"notifications/elicitation/complete and elicitationId in URL mode","text":"The notifications/elicitation/complete notification and the elicitationId field of URL mode elicitation requests, introduced in 2025-11-25, are removed in this draft."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t80_o16"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t80_c11","object":"superseding earlier restriction","predicate":"are loosened to allow any JSON Schema 2020-12 keywords","stance":"superseded","subject":"inputSchema and outputSchema","text":"inputSchema and outputSchema are loosened to allow any JSON Schema 2020-12 keywords, superseding the earlier restriction."},{"about":["error code allocation","HeaderMismatch renumbering"],"kind":"question","local_id":"t80_q1","needed":"Check the error codes section of the basic index in later spec revisions and the schema for HeaderMismatchError.","text":"Is the error code partition (-32000 to -32019 grandfathered, -32020 to -32099 reserved) and renumbered draft codes (HeaderMismatch -32020, MissingRequiredClientCapability -32021, UnsupportedProtocolVersion -32022) kept later?"}],"scope":{"docs":["d_e78b49b5f4912f5115eb9b9dbd5b8785bf919e27b2c1bfd2e93e784e7ef9a936"],"ranges":[["d_e78b49b5f4912f5115eb9b9dbd5b8785bf919e27b2c1bfd2e93e784e7ef9a936",4413,8411]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"4831712941970b8a5a4fff027ec397649b6d056c2e7c7a632b2f8ca1542e529e","outcome":{"kind":"records","result":{"accepted":["834cac53a63f4ee300393eba594eac5e0bc60000740c85d3f3e7823883663bd8","80955b6aa139f699eec781788194ec0a175082712c92c689ea5b480040998ad5","40731716186769230549755f78387f0f666c4dd0cea48760fe071d3a4ed057b1","4ecfbb3c14f85e995bd39f93e519334bb63a6529152f2a2ca97cc7528f9d4ab9","ae5651f0d03ecd3c27838622cfed447a00a8d68b773f5f700367bb0cf8356a8c","c9686899a695d52edb957fbdf4cc6f24815e120dd940309000df66d3497af267","ad66fda9bd33940f0977e3c63bd8de962223481341581f89b5f00853bca27d51","af5dc680805548088e0c7743dd98769ef07ade90eedf0f42d9dc488c6fb185aa"],"error":null,"failed_index":null}},"request_hash":"a66a878895315aecd2b89ce8dd041af3130134aa200593eebae1dc95cb9306e6","submission_id":"T80-d9df528eccae31ec#2"},"hash":"8dfc30a1e722d26f0be5615278dbe593a8314c5b9834a6474b6912268940b3c7","header":{"body_hash":"0923059fac3fbbed7b67c84f2840603aaebb0a69db5811aa5f6e2b12717872c5","format":"sbgk-session-log/3","previous":"b2d186a387b7da855bde8dbc45faf2960a1b5a7eb0a587a5218c617aa886341e","records_root":"1ed4647b815b1dccb82fab97892a1df1342371fd6993fc7bc250a394b61856e7","seq":391,"wal_op":"audit"}}
