or the server to exit, or sending `SIGTERM` if the server does not exit\n   within a reasonable time","kind":"observe","local_id":"t91o5","terms":["stdio shutdown","SIGTERM timing","2025-06-18 revision"]},{"as_of":20250326,"based_on":["t91o2","t91o3"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t91c1","object":"no numeric timeout value","predicate":"are not specified as numeric defaults or ranges; only SHOULD-level guidance is given","stance":"confirmed","subject":"timeout values","text":"The Timeouts section recommends establishing timeouts for all sent requests and per-request configuration in SDKs, but states no numeric default or range."},{"as_of":20250326,"based_on":["t91o1","t91o5"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t91c2","object":"a reasonable time, undefined","predicate":"is left as","stance":"confirmed","subject":"stdio escalation timing","text":"The stdio shutdown steps wait 'a reasonable time' before SIGTERM and again before SIGKILL, with no defined duration in either the 2025-03-26 or 2025-06-18 text."},{"as_of":20250326,"based_on":["t91o4"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t91c3","object":"unspecified maximum","predicate":"SHOULD be enforced without a stated value","stance":"confirmed","subject":"maximum timeout","text":"Implementations SHOULD enforce a maximum timeout regardless of progress notifications, but the maximum itself has no stated value."}],"scope":{"docs":["d_0d6aa094546300c922e9f888e59a2a42387e1ab9eb3a5eba2887add9eaae4804","d_487ca4ef224fdb205202f2d1e490f283ebe2344493a1f4c00e2cc952de5a677d"],"ranges":[["d_0d6aa094546300c922e9f888e59a2a42387e1ab9eb3a5eba2887add9eaae4804",5980,7942],["d_487ca4ef224fdb205202f2d1e490f283ebe2344493a1f4c00e2cc952de5a677d",5981,8196]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"1189e3aa5b4f6fe02603f848a9ef00b640f05fb809073ca4545f5f0bc8a18cc2","outcome":{"kind":"records","result":{"accepted":["cc8bdb0081fb5e07a789da4b5aeac311551d6b7c73ed87a856cf744672d47259","38ead7d23d4ec73211155c3568eedfc16448248aaa9ac79e44c56d6f45f92138","369c0ca5d2fc939a9a6c424aaee583f