med","subject":"intermediary version-based rejection","text":"Intermediary rejection of requests with older or absent MCP-Protocol-Version remains SHOULD, not MUST; only returning an HTTP error status on validation failure is MUST."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t100_o4"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t100_c3","object":"SHOULD retry with refreshed headers","predicate":"requirement level","stance":"confirmed","subject":"client retry after HeaderMismatch","text":"Client retry after a HeaderMismatch rejection remains SHOULD (call tools/list then retry), not MUST."},{"about":["custom-headers requirement strength across revisions"],"kind":"question","local_id":"t100_q1","needed":"Compare the custom-headers/Server Validation text in other spec revision sections of this corpus for MUST vs SHOULD wording on these three items.","text":"Do any revisions other than 2026-07-28 (e.g., earlier drafts) state the numeric comparison, intermediary version rejection, or client retry as MUST, so a tightening across revisions can be confirmed or ruled out?"}],"scope":{"docs":["d_0b1e9103fea8fa5ef272198e7fcb3c264c0d113b3cb79352242dd7fd7884d30d","d_36ab192089a83fd6eabe54d7808ec33520aa72f22c33d5866c34b0aebcb7a530"],"ranges":[["d_36ab192089a83fd6eabe54d7808ec33520aa72f22c33d5866c34b0aebcb7a530",20841,26565],["d_0b1e9103fea8fa5ef272198e7fcb3c264c0d113b3cb79352242dd7fd7884d30d",0,5880]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"e92ac983a7184e2bd72cc2c173ff1e1e7e1dd78205931b92bc8263ec396f90c9","outcome":{"kind":"records","result":{"accepted":["d38f96cb10881207dce0cfd22b397c7dade7db4cc025ca3b7b15cdf61aaf41c5","78297e245063b1d62e57aedf82436cd5c56b2d84782728f5efc1c3d3bf801a12","8da0fdb7d24faa9fb64d2aafce5a4fe22b44b46f61cf066d0a80c08dc05d86f9","0ed386ca4082e216387ff01a62bce44b65d4e49bbdd763dabafc1ea51aee2e94","fe57d067b5118298f97864e14bb1b66a4dd52e3133641facaa4d2899f477fcc9","a2c2a420f5657c588ab25c02afd6645858d8fcb43100c37336911a209e1b47a4"],"error":null,"failed_index":null}},"request_hash":"85c16790dd411f14e7431f