ocol version negotiated during initialization - the server **SHOULD** assume protocol\nversion `2025-03-26`.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t92_o9","terms":["server assumes protocol 2025-03-26 when the MCP-Protocol-Version header is absent and no other version identification exists"]},{"doc_id":"d_1ec5d9d1465c47e1696aa6369bdc6582a4210481ce571922656ff4fa73cb170b","exact_quote":"has no other way to identify the version - for example, by relying on the\nprotocol version negotiated during initialization - the server **SHOULD** assume protocol\nversion `2025-03-26`.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t92_o10","terms":["condition that the server has no other way to identify the protocol version"]},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t92_o1"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t92_c1","object":"old SSE and POST endpoints alongside the MCP endpoint","predicate":"should continue to host","stance":"reported","subject":"servers supporting older clients","text":"Servers wanting to support older clients should continue to host both the SSE and POST endpoints of the old transport alongside the new MCP endpoint."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t92_o3","t92_o10","t92_o9"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t92_c4","object":"protocol version 2025-03-26","predicate":"should assume","stance":"reported","subject":"requests lacking MCP-Protocol-Version header with no other version identification","text":"A server receiving no MCP-Protocol-Version header, with no other way to identify the version, should assume protocol version 2025-03-26."}],"scope":{"docs":["d_1ec5d9d1465c47e1696aa6369bdc6582a4210481ce571922656ff4fa73cb170b","d_36ab192089a83fd6eabe54d7808ec33520aa72f22c33d5866c34b0aebcb7a530"],"ranges":[["d_1ec5d9d1465c47e1696aa6369bdc6582a4210481ce571922656ff4fa73cb170b",11113,13956],["d_36ab192089a83fd6eabe54d7808ec33520aa72f22c33d5866c34b0aebcb7a530",0,4380]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"19140f555a5ec495130a683bb2d398269cc9bc3de951c7b2fd3feba8511a4024","outcome":{"kind":"records","result":{"accepted":["69e7fb16ce38