{"body":{"actor":"w1","audit_root":"eac2f24f76196652f7b5d028fe56db32a147037e573226ab8f4743d57b7d3bda","command":{"allowed_records":["52f58b1153599df4142bcc1f04bcaa8aadac42532473e1acd1a4077aceb36a95","6bc4d327a5c20c4b1e073dd803a559e368474a5202878e98e932d12cfa1d0cac","f7546fd44ab02b6391c503e434b9a541e3bf527fe333da56847e9598397184e9"],"directive":"TQ120-87d5f4f73f1a47a3","kind":"submit","lines":[{"doc_id":"d_68a9337c46c31a3f0e9eafcca98f89260dc7a424155fdeaa631a415f80aa23eb","exact_quote":"- The `result` **MUST** include a `resultType` field to indicate the type of the result.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t120_o1","terms":["resultType required","result responses"]},{"doc_id":"d_68a9337c46c31a3f0e9eafcca98f89260dc7a424155fdeaa631a415f80aa23eb","exact_quote":"- For backward compatibility with servers implementing earlier protocol versions, which do not include `resultType`, clients **MUST** treat an absent `resultType` as `\"complete\"`.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t120_o2","terms":["absent resultType","backward compatibility","complete"]},{"doc_id":"d_68a9337c46c31a3f0e9eafcca98f89260dc7a424155fdeaa631a415f80aa23eb","exact_quote":"- A `resultType` of any value unrecognized by the client **MUST** be considered invalid.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t120_o3","terms":["unrecognized resultType","invalid"]},{"as_of":20260728,"based_on":["t120_o2"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t120_c1","object":"\"complete\" by clients","predicate":"MUST be treated as","stance":"confirmed","subject":"absent resultType from earlier-version servers","text":"In the 2026-07-28 revision, the absent-resultType backward-compatibility rule is retained: clients MUST treat an absent resultType as \"complete\" for servers implementing earlier protocol versions."},{"as_of":20260728,"based_on":["t120_o1"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t120_c2","object":"a resultType field","predicate":"MUST include","stance":"confirmed","subject":"result field in result responses","text":"The same revision requires result responses to include a resultType field, so the absent-resultType accommodation coexists with a mandatory resultType requirement."},{"based_on":["t120_o2"],"falsifier":"A later revision stating the absent-resultType-as-complete rule as permanent or unconditional without version scoping.","kind":"hypothesis","local_id":"t120_h1","text":"The absent-resultType-as-complete rule is retained but remains version-scoped (only for servers implementing earlier protocol versions), not made permanent or unconditional."},{"about":["absent resultType","backward compatibility","later revisions"],"kind":"question","local_id":"t120_q1","needed":"Result-response sections of revisions after 2026-07-28; compare the absent resultType clause wording and version scoping.","text":"Do any revisions later than 2026-07-28 exist in this corpus, and if so do their result-response sections retain, qualify or remove the absent-resultType clause?"}],"scope":{"docs":["d_68a9337c46c31a3f0e9eafcca98f89260dc7a424155fdeaa631a415f80aa23eb"],"ranges":[["d_68a9337c46c31a3f0e9eafcca98f89260dc7a424155fdeaa631a415f80aa23eb",0,4563]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"0aed08f52f00cd5789d6e40679b5325d8986129b3ed24b8f238f0ee5a459341b","outcome":{"kind":"records","result":{"accepted":["673ea066b4eb6a35d563fa0b5b5d9adea3410b6aa75091d78fe96f1bce4118c7","084690a843c37ca6de6eab436bc5964a0db4d11dbbe2fd9f2aa35076d6bdb6d8","c00c4fbcef0747f4d7bf126b550174552e13b929ba19b6194ff22e091a09f315","6086a0c8f63092a9d1fc4c7f39ee5e4e2256ccfa5434f0999c27758bd19c608b","a5de264411bff7642ce55482e61d5cf2963484ac854fef4d4bb02b9516d1ad7f","4a5ba82276c9f6f1b818110cd6cdd3704c6c97c44b0389c57d4456660d849a60","dfc2cf3321b39148f2fe8b8d662e04b0afba3635c97f2b001a3bc920256b856e"],"error":null,"failed_index":null}},"request_hash":"4d1d4bfd64848e3a2cd5e1864f79d635e1f268a29935e544d8b8f84147bb2edd","submission_id":"TQ120-87d5f4f73f1a47a3#1"},"hash":"2effdfce9af26765b5e48bc5c968c914c78811a327125ea0ca4b2ae0cd193777","header":{"body_hash":"33d8de700946230c3ef81