121_c1","object":"subsections of this Transports section","predicate":"are specified in","stance":"confirmed","subject":"session management, resumability-and-redelivery, custom transports","text":"Session management, resumability-and-redelivery and custom transports are each specified in their own subsections of this Transports section, not only linked from elsewhere."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t121_o1","t121_o2"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t121_c2","object":"clients and servers","predicate":"are permitted in a pluggable fashion with no further requirements stated","stance":"qualified","subject":"custom transports","text":"Custom transports are permitted for clients and servers in a pluggable fashion, but the section gives no normative requirements for them beyond that statement."},{"about":["session management","resumability-and-redelivery","custom transports","optionality"],"kind":"question","local_id":"t121_q1","needed":"Fetch the three anchors in this same specification revision and compare their normative keywords against the MAY/SHOULD statements quoted here.","text":"Do the linked #session-management, #resumability-and-redelivery and #custom-transports anchors resolve to the same revision's subsections, and does any of them impose MUST where this section says MAY?"}],"scope":{"docs":["d_1ec5d9d1465c47e1696aa6369bdc6582a4210481ce571922656ff4fa73cb170b"],"ranges":[["d_1ec5d9d1465c47e1696aa6369bdc6582a4210481ce571922656ff4fa73cb170b",0,5241],["d_1ec5d9d1465c47e1696aa6369bdc6582a4210481ce571922656ff4fa73cb170b",5241,11113]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"43c2bad5776f446fdedb655b90e04acb005adcd726f3a0bd0109b9be92028380","outcome":{"kind":"records","result":{"accepted":["e4f1e1c8bbe30280cdaefbd80a79a8fd06a88f8fa94d4dcbefc04d222eb24e7b","13afc6407aacb5505ee8cf678bd4e540c136c7e20e7555968af8770b85b57f3c","3ba2713b3076caccaacbb5fba8d9fb091bef3adcd35552e52dc92fef4dddf3ea","5b4d1e1df1732078161db5eddc9d584183f9f077e59d6cc88acc75f0a9032c3f","20b98ae3b1dbe4d6c761970e9d1fdc