ession-management)\n     expires.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t121_o7","terms":["session expiry","SSE stream close exception"]},{"doc_id":"d_1ec5d9d1465c47e1696aa6369bdc6582a4210481ce571922656ff4fa73cb170b","exact_quote":"- To avoid message loss due to disconnection, the server **MAY** make the stream\n       [resumable](#resumability-and-redelivery).","kind":"observe","local_id":"t121_o8","terms":["resumability link","optional"]},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t121_o4","t121_o8"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t121_c3","object":"SSE event ids and resumable streams","predicate":"are optional (MAY)","stance":"confirmed","subject":"resumability and redelivery","text":"Resumability and redelivery are optional: servers MAY attach SSE event ids, and the server MAY make the stream resumable to avoid message loss on disconnection."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t121_o6"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t121_c4","object":"Mcp-Session-Id at initialization","predicate":"is optional (MAY assign session ID)","stance":"confirmed","subject":"session management","text":"Session management is optional: a Streamable HTTP server MAY assign a session ID at initialization via Mcp-Session-Id."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t121_o8","t121_o7"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t121_c5","object":"resumability and session expiry","predicate":"is restated as MAY, with session expiry as exception","stance":"qualified","subject":"optional behaviour in this section","text":"The optional resumability behaviour is referenced from the POST SSE rules as a MAY, and session expiry is the stated exception to keeping the SSE stream open."}],"scope":{"docs":["d_1ec5d9d1465c47e1696aa6369bdc6582a4210481ce571922656ff4fa73cb170b"],"ranges":[["d_1ec5d9d1465c47e1696aa6369bdc6582a4210481ce571922656ff4fa73cb170b",0,5241],["d_1ec5d9d1465c47e1696aa6369bdc6582a4210481ce571922656ff4fa73cb170b",5241,11113]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"2e3be1254569356f57d0e7cf402424f6ba884c647d66e7fca7e6be788cc831ef","outcome":{"kind":"records","result