ion path","2026-07-28"]},{"as_of":20251125,"based_on":["t135_o1"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t135_c1","object":"a recommended client registration mechanism","predicate":"are added as","stance":"qualified","subject":"OAuth Client ID Metadata Documents","text":"The 2025-11-25 Key Changes list Client ID Metadata Documents only as a recommended client registration mechanism, with no MUST-level requirement stated there."},{"as_of":20260728,"based_on":["t135_o2","t135_o3"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t135_c2","object":"Dynamic Client Registration","predicate":"is listed as migration path for","stance":"reported","subject":"Client ID Metadata Documents","text":"The Deprecated Features registry (2026-07-28) names Client ID Metadata Documents as the migration path for deprecated Dynamic Client Registration, but states no SHOULD/MUST strength for it."},{"about":["Client ID Metadata Documents requirement strength","draft vs final RFC citation","later revisions of Client Registration"],"kind":"question","local_id":"t135_q1","needed":"Fetch the Client Registration section of the 2026-07-28 revision and any later revision; compare requirement keywords and the IETF draft/RFC reference against draft-ietf-oauth-client-id-metadata-document-00.","text":"Do the 2026-07-28 Client Registration section and any later revision state Client ID Metadata Documents support as SHOULD or MUST, and do they cite draft-ietf-oauth-client-id-metadata-document-00 or a final RFC?"}],"scope":{"docs":["d_2178db3bf707039cc2ca70aa1c76bf0903f35819e621456b9389455111ac6bd4","d_2d5d1c30808cf2e9d696698905b14bfd08aaeeed481e5171fe99bdb662c1848f"],"ranges":[["d_2178db3bf707039cc2ca70aa1c76bf0903f35819e621456b9389455111ac6bd4",0,5031],["d_2d5d1c30808cf2e9d696698905b14bfd08aaeeed481e5171fe99bdb662c1848f",0,5262]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"63c08b5689a7f05ec4fc4361c2a2ad9f4a44f72b5452e5f61d3a286396ed5fd4","outcome":{"kind":"records","result":{"accepted":["9dfa516a36f4837395000d86881fcd516fee7ebd49a765db04bfdb30454f6