t."},{"about":["initialize version negotiation","pre-initialization request restrictions","2026-07-28 lifecycle"],"kind":"question","local_id":"t131_q1","needed":"Fetch /specification/2026-07-28/basic/lifecycle and /specification/2026-07-28/basic/versioning (the page linked as lifecycle-version) and compare requirement keywords in the Initialization and Version Negotiation subsections against the 2025-03-26 text.","text":"Does the 2026-07-28 Lifecycle or Versioning page turn the initialize latest-version SHOULDs, the disconnect SHOULD, and the pre-initialization SHOULD NOT rules into MUST?"}],"scope":{"docs":["d_0d6aa094546300c922e9f888e59a2a42387e1ab9eb3a5eba2887add9eaae4804","d_36ab192089a83fd6eabe54d7808ec33520aa72f22c33d5866c34b0aebcb7a530"],"ranges":[["d_0d6aa094546300c922e9f888e59a2a42387e1ab9eb3a5eba2887add9eaae4804",0,5980],["d_36ab192089a83fd6eabe54d7808ec33520aa72f22c33d5866c34b0aebcb7a530",10358,14905]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"0060f48c4b21de859800d42ac10c8014f56c504b8d85be61734395ac955b5dd0","outcome":{"kind":"records","result":{"accepted":["6fded1793a0eb4c864408a2c79bd0e8714b64643d2585b827428627d8210f4da","28b211528b015b1735ddd5aa1d2d678bb87e186b8c331d7ff51e045019a30c6c","6b85eb33222b177457e00586b5cfa5beed9d2ce2bd5f1bcde1f7b6eafa2fe230","b3ed3f4f02c160715ffbef44cc76e6fa6cd3aeb2b889404f764c2ff0a351d9fe","db1cd9dfd9a833ee962c6f21ee4e65ff0d62e1fe1bc3972171ab111796a0f5bb","bfeeb7fd5231ad5928991ad893d28e720a6e270c0bcd511678fa37f51bfe408e"],"error":null,"failed_index":null}},"request_hash":"1efbfe3b631a62c7ea3e1b6b6ac57b5e7704a306c4109f81c74b0374bd2c161e","submission_id":"TQ131-bc3330f619679c37#1"},"hash":"3e42f7aa6adf7f29ff3baf6edb234c77369817a7e8ba2ba5060536c23304e9d8","header":{"body_hash":"05276b4120746fa2165d8967e92d2f50b5f6e9032ab8fc6f0f44ed2659f6ae8e","format":"sbgk-session-log/3","previous":"d9d88415ac0fcc09c848dbc7a02b4aaeca473186e9ae19779c128f9f072f4b79","records_root":"b08c8ecce327b997ec013a20d0bec4a4f199a7cc9b031f950d1a5adac07669db","seq":626