5a677d","exact_quote":"- The client **SHOULD NOT** send requests other than\n  [pings](/specification/2025-06-18/basic/utilities/ping) before the server has responded to the\n  `initialize` request.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t86_o5","terms":["client pre-initialization request","ping exception","2025-06-18"]},{"doc_id":"d_487ca4ef224fdb205202f2d1e490f283ebe2344493a1f4c00e2cc952de5a677d","exact_quote":"- The server **SHOULD NOT** send requests other than\n  [pings](/specification/2025-06-18/basic/utilities/ping) and\n  [logging](/specification/2025-06-18/server/utilities/logging) before receiving the `initialized`\n  notification.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t86_o7","terms":["server logging exception","initialized notification","2025-06-18"]},{"as_of":20250618,"based_on":["t86_o2","t86_o4","t86_o5"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t86_c1","object":"pings","predicate":"SHOULD NOT send requests other than","stance":"confirmed","subject":"client requests before initialize response","text":"In MCP 2025-06-18, client requests prior to the initialize response remain restricted to pings, matching 2025-03-26."},{"as_of":20250618,"based_on":["t86_o3","t86_o4","t86_o6","t86_o7"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t86_c2","object":"pings and logging","predicate":"SHOULD NOT send requests other than","stance":"confirmed","subject":"server requests before initialized notification","text":"In MCP 2025-06-18, server requests prior to the initialized notification remain restricted to pings and logging, matching 2025-03-26."},{"as_of":20250618,"based_on":["t86_o1","t86_o2","t86_o3","t86_o4","t86_o5","t86_o6"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t86_c3","object":"2025-06-18 protocol revision","predicate":"were not modified or superseded in","stance":"confirmed","subject":"pre-initialization messaging constraints and exceptions","text":"Pre-initialization messaging constraints and ping/logging exceptions were not modified or superseded in the 2025-06-18 revision."},{"based_on":["t86_o6","t86_o7"],"falsifier":"A post-2025-06-18 lifecycle specification retaining the pre-initialization server logging exception unchanged despite logging deprecation","kind":"hypothesis","local_id":"t86_h1","text":"Protocol revisions following the 2026-07-28 logging deprecation remove or modify the pre-initialization server logging exception while keeping ping exceptions."}],"scope":{"docs":["d_0d6aa094546300c922e9f888e59a2a42387e1ab9eb3a5eba2887add9eaae4804","d_487ca4ef224fdb205202f2d1e490f283ebe2344493a1f4c00e2cc952de5a677d"],"ranges":[["d_0d6aa094546300c922e9f888e59a2a42387e1ab9eb3a5eba2887add9eaae4804",0,5980],["d_487ca4ef224fdb205202f2d1e490f283ebe2344493a1f4c00e2cc952de5a677d",0,5981]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"9b3f55de132c77559822354602c7c3bb1b498bf43a4eb7a5a1856bafcd4e3846","outcome":{"kind":"records","result":{"accepted":["37da00ceb1203efb6b49b777e32d193656f45aaaf5dd5843dee754b63ee09d0e","b9f46bf30eaedebe8631ce85ea8336317bcc5d2b849a955b4ea974e06ed6e852","4046b4842adc3d13a17ec48d2cf0e9a88632dcd1dd2017b4e322d4c3d0028776","7763cc5bc90c9f9ed06d32291058eef5c26b2657fda363f956f2c5b82ddfc9f8","4fc01d59f0ff14fdd04e59664139e96fa327ee7e4c752c548f85c594e8100f70","61131811dd5048cb7bc5279f3366821ce360eaf4bb81737025aeb5ce4e59a678","48706013eae6e95c5bb835df6ee7c6495cabfbf54a86efa4e41c69da7147c045","b1b32be2901e93796f76e9a1674c1397275f4f1ea8c4c2eee786886a37149068","6baa9f0e0bb1f0b05e2adf14b59c4ae94d56bcb63ea4473aa2daa854d8988d70"],"error":null,"failed_index":null}},"request_hash":"42703bf18e39712f1c79f6f7953afe6fcf94e55f266f9bc31b2dc11f3c375407","submission_id":"TQ86-2ddec0bc82d7f1cc#2"},"hash":"44e691f1d5ea77a1cc6d5353960cecb48f588b48f434109eac490d62b54e2c9a","header":{"body_hash":"cea3589da9b0cbbdb809d805f8b3c3c1d199f5532d0cfddc120975be61548718","format":"sbgk-session-log/3","previous":"458fbe4039eb3899d1e93a109f3e9e93e369198d5b60c14b08bb80ee4b9fc070","records_root":"96232d577d1c7af2a8d4663c2993767ec15f172fba7b62f9346ce9e074960369","seq":632,"wal_op":"audit"}}
