T","later revision"]},{"doc_id":"d_487ca4ef224fdb205202f2d1e490f283ebe2344493a1f4c00e2cc952de5a677d","exact_quote":"- Client implementation information","kind":"observe","local_id":"t142_o5","terms":["clientInfo as required content of initialize","later revision"]},{"doc_id":"d_487ca4ef224fdb205202f2d1e490f283ebe2344493a1f4c00e2cc952de5a677d","exact_quote":"The server **MUST** respond with its own capabilities and information:","kind":"observe","local_id":"t142_o6","terms":["serverInfo requirement","later revision"]},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t142_o1","t142_o2","t142_o3"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t142_c1","object":"client implementation information; server capabilities and information","predicate":"are required by MUST initialize request and response","stance":"reported","subject":"clientInfo/serverInfo identification","text":"In the 2025-03-26 Lifecycle, clientInfo and serverInfo are already required content of the MUST initialize request/response, not SHOULD items."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t142_o4","t142_o5","t142_o6"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t142_c2","object":"client implementation information; server capabilities and information","predicate":"remain under MUST initialize request/response","stance":"reported","subject":"clientInfo/serverInfo identification in later revision","text":"The later 2025-06-18 Lifecycle keeps the same MUST wording for initialize request content (client implementation information) and server response information; no tightening from SHOULD to MUST is visible."},{"about":["clientInfo","serverInfo","Key Changes","base protocol page"],"kind":"question","local_id":"t142_q1","needed":"Check Key Changes sections and base protocol pages of all revisions for clientInfo/serverInfo requirement-level wording.","text":"Does any revision's Key Changes section or base protocol page state clientInfo/serverInfo as SHOULD, and if so does a later revision raise it to MUST?"}],"scope":{"docs":["d_0d6aa094546300c922e9f888e59a2a42387e1ab9eb3a5eba288